- `actor(a_default, "Default", [...])`: Assigns all nodes to "Default" instead of "resellers", contradicting the source text "For resellers, the process begins... Simultaneously, they need to complete..." (SMC7).
- `action(n5, "end process")` and `precedence(c1, n5)`: Hallucinates an explicit task step not described in the source, which simply states "Once these steps are completed, the process comes to an end," implying immediate termination after synchronization without an intermediate action. (SMC1)